.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=faaFLic2_pgQ7kNvwHPBt-_&_nc_oc=AdkZ4TRZx2c9zsqAvTvnCcTC02Mmc4bZZJCNOJNR-oioA0LS1liGI-jPDoYvOz6DbM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxEiyRMoumLmUrualoCtnK7ZkFWzkPwfikwQglHDukcTQ&oe=69AC2498"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jNzqfN3UoHkQ7kNvwG-EZYD&_nc_oc=Adm_BhdlW7-j4lN_BglYq1K_inNeBlTmKBUiCo-k6zx7zvQG6NH82X4G1kEPSFlQFi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyIsB5QDGTkGO4dE0bK6SkJq7kdr6FgIRu9oFFNjxOJiQ&oe=69AC21C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s_4qXAXSpU4Q7kNvwHKdJLg&_nc_oc=Adnb_5Tv2BGh-h--YF9bOMX9VGTtZv0H7oCYkp6QDnQS57Hc_iiTlW--ZD6YDEA6GC0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxNtcucQ8ZwM2i00MtbQe-BO97onJcVK78JAaEfiE0DBA&oe=69AC21F3"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p